  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ki can be shared with others.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Endow Ki<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You need spend only 1 point from your ki pool to use this feat as a full-round action, though you can expend 2 points from your ki pool to use it as a swift action. You add your mythic tier to the number of minutes your ally retains the ki feat you grant, and if you expend one use of your mythic power, your ally gains temporary use of any two ki feats you know, which may include ki feat along with its mythic version.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
